Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung tama yung ginagawa ng ating mga kinukunan, lalo na po yung first family.

1985
01:47:31,820 --> 01:47:37,840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi sometimes we tend to move na we're not thinking na may nakasunod palang camera dyan.

1986
01:47:38,020 --> 01:47:44,760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So kahit ako minsan, nakanganga ako, nakagano, nagkakamot ako ng kung ano, nagkakamot ako ng kilikili,

1987
01:47:45,560 --> 01:47:49,600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: na dinudukot ako ng ganito, masama tignan sa camera.

1988
01:47:49,860 --> 01:47:54,100
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So baka pwede natin sabihin yung ating mga crew na be careful.

1989
01:47:54,800 --> 01:47:56,560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung lalo na alam ko na.

1990
01:47:56,680 --> 01:48:00,960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pag nagpapaning siguro dyan, dapat yung director po alam din yan na,

1991
01:48:01,020 --> 01:48:05,820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: oh, oops, iwasan mo muna si ganito, hindi nakabantay, medyo pangit tignan.

1992
01:48:06,200 --> 01:48:11,520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yung decision ba, yung judgment, na will this reflect pag napanood ng tao,

1993
01:48:11,520 --> 01:48:16,420
Senator Erwin Tulfo: baka katawa-tawa naman yung ating VIP, nakakahiya naman,

1994
01:48:17,080 --> 01:48:22,200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: o yung itong isang VIP natin, naglalakad, party for example,

1995
01:48:22,400 --> 01:48:25,700
Senator Erwin Tulfo: iwasan na siguro, okay lang, nagpag-usap.

1996
01:48:26,680 --> 01:48:30,620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sudden movements, dapat pinapatay ko ka agad, pina-fan ka agad natin somewhere.

1997
01:48:30,720 --> 01:48:36,480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I mean, I work on TV since 1996 to about 2004.

1998
01:48:36,480 --> 01:48:41,980
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So alam ko, hindi ako cameraman, pero nag-aral din ako maging cameraman.

1999
01:48:42,140 --> 01:48:47,200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pinag-aaralan ko na sa ABS po ako, naglalaro-laro ako, pinaglalaroan ko yung mga camera.

2000
01:48:47,580 --> 01:48:51,480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaya alam ko, at saka alam ko naman may mga floor director, di po ba na,

2001
01:48:52,040 --> 01:48:55,760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: pan-left ka o camera 2, punta mo si ganito.

2002
01:48:55,760 --> 01:49:02,120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero iwaka pwede natin iwasan, just remind our people na huwag naman yung mga pangit na shot,

2003
01:49:02,280 --> 01:49:03,820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: hindi naman maganda yun, di ba?

2004
01:49:04,020 --> 01:49:11,260
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May ngumunguya, pangit, mamaya-maya yung VIP natin, nangungulangot,

2005
01:49:11,560 --> 01:49:13,840
Senator Erwin Tulfo: iwasan natin kasi hindi maganda.

2006
01:49:14,500 --> 01:49:19,020
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kaya marami na nga tayong kalaban, yun ho, ipi-play up nila sa video nila.

2007
01:49:19,520 --> 01:49:24,800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Di ho ba? I mean, Secretary Dave, yun ipi-play up ng mga kalaban para masama tignan.

2008
01:49:24,800 --> 01:49:26,400
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Eh, kawawa naman ho.

2009
01:49:27,000 --> 01:49:28,960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, it's just a manifestation.

2010
01:49:30,220 --> 01:49:34,540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Mas maganda ho yung coverage natin. Piliin natin yung mga videos natin.

2011
01:49:35,100 --> 01:49:37,380
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Huwag lang tira lang, tira lalo po yung mga camera.

2012
01:49:37,600 --> 01:49:41,520
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I'm sure sanay naman po sila sa mga ika nga presidential coverage, di po ba?

2013
01:49:42,420 --> 01:49:47,000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Lalo na po sa mga parties like that, may mga events.

2014
01:49:47,480 --> 01:49:51,220
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kasi po hindi alam natin ang VIP na may sumusunod sa kanya na camera, di po ba?

2015
01:49:51,220 --> 01:49:54,220
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, ang may kasalanan po doon, yung camera man,

2016
01:49:54,800 --> 01:49:58,680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: director na nagbibigay na nagsiswitch na pan mo sa kanan,

2017
01:49:58,900 --> 01:50:00,560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: babahan mo ng konti, kaliwa mo,

2018
01:50:00,980 --> 01:50:04,680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: oops, si VIP natin, di magandang pwesto yan, di magandang angulo,

2019
01:50:05,000 --> 01:50:07,200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: alisin mo dyan, lipat muna tayo switch.

2020
01:50:07,280 --> 01:50:10,180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Ilang cameras po ba ang ginagamit yung isang coverage, sir?

2021
01:50:10,860 --> 01:50:15,420
RTVM Undersecretary Franz Gerard R. Imperial: Sa isang coverage, sir, kung maliit na coverage po, normally is three.

2022
01:50:16,200 --> 01:50:17,300
RTVM Undersecretary Franz Gerard R. Imperial: Yan ang pinakaminimo.

2023
01:50:17,300 --> 01:50:21,120
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Sa mga events po, mga parties na pinupuntahan po ng Pangulo,

2024
01:50:21,320 --> 01:50:24,800
Senator Erwin Tulfo: mga ika nga ceremony, mga ilan ho ang daladalan yung camera,

2025
01:50:24,800 --> 01:50:25,340
Senator Erwin Tulfo: mga camera dyan.

2026
01:50:26,000 --> 01:50:28,560
RTVM Undersecretary Franz Gerard R. Imperial: Bigger events, mga four lang po.

2027
01:50:29,000 --> 01:50:31,880
RTVM Undersecretary Franz Gerard R. Imperial: Pero ang pinakamarami po namin normally is Sona.

2028
01:50:32,700 --> 01:50:35,740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pero may mga direct contact po, yung mga camera man yun,

2029
01:50:35,800 --> 01:50:39,240
Senator Erwin Tulfo: kasi nakakita ko po dahil may communications, di po ba?

2030
01:50:39,340 --> 01:50:42,200
Senator Erwin Tulfo: At meron po director na ikita niya kung anong magandang angulo.

2031
01:50:42,500 --> 01:50:44,260
RTVM Undersecretary Franz Gerard R. Imperial: Definitely, sir, meron naman po.

2032
01:50:44,280 --> 01:50:48,460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Baka pwede po natin maiwasan na ho yung magagandang pangit ho na angulo minsan,

2033
01:50:48,580 --> 01:50:49,320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: yung VIP natin.

2034
01:50:49,440 --> 01:50:53,540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi lang po yung president of first family, pati mga secretaries natin,

2035
01:50:53,540 --> 01:50:54,480
Senator Erwin Tulfo: minsan baka mamaya.

2036
01:50:54,800 --> 01:50:56,760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: May ginagawa, hindi po maganda na.

2037
01:50:58,400 --> 01:51:00,720
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Unconsciously, akala nila walang video coverage.

2038
01:51:00,880 --> 01:51:02,540
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yun pala, nakukunan na ho sila.

2039
01:51:03,320 --> 01:51:06,500
Senator Erwin Tulfo: At this day and age, nako, mabilis po pick-uping agad yan.

2040
01:51:07,120 --> 01:51:09,620
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Bagamat hindi po fake news yan, yun ay pe-play up.

2041
01:51:09,760 --> 01:51:13,880
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kawawa naman ho yung ating ika nga subject.

2042
01:51:14,700 --> 01:51:19,580
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Tapos sasabihin, kita mo, kita mo, tala itong ginawa niya, di ba?

2043
01:51:20,500 --> 01:51:22,780
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kung mali na ho, hindi na maganda tignan.

2044
01:51:22,980 --> 01:51:24,640
